/** \addtogroup documenting
  * @{

\section doc_intro Documenting mxlib Code

mxlib uses doxygen.

\section doc_tests Documenting Tests 

mxlib uses the Catch2 unit testing framework.

To document tests:

1. Group each test case/scenario using the appropriate `*_unit_tests` doxygen group.
2. Organize test groups to mirror the `include/` folder hierarchy.
3. Avoid explicit anchor/test command links between source and tests.
4. Be sure that the directory containing the test file is included in mxlib_doxygen.in.


@}
*/

 
